commit f6d3f538d8beb5b796cd913abffbffcde611857f
Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:03:36 2026 +0330

    fix(qa4-new4,qa4-img18): targeting section renders camp.targeting; platform warning chips
    
    - new4: AdsStrategyRenderer targeting chain audience ??
      audience_targeting ?? targeting with field-based shape detection;
      renders audience_summary/age_range/locations/interests/exclusions
      (skipping empties) so Meta campaigns with thin audience{} and
      Google (targeting-only) show a filled TARGETING section
      (AdsStrategyRenderer.vue:72-134,212-244). normalizeResponse keeps
      'targeting' passthrough (test pins the contract).
    - img18: PlatformRecommendationSummary renders w.platform as a labeled
      chip (PLATFORM_WARNING_LABELS map + capitalized fallback,
      data-testid=platform-warning-chip) instead of the raw '[linkedin]'
      bracket interpolation (PlatformRecommendationSummary.vue:15-32,111-118).
    - AdsStrategyRenderer.test.ts (8), PlatformRecommendationSummary.test.ts (4),
      useNormalizeResponse.test.ts (5).

